            <bounds x="8" y="26" width="404" height="22" />
            <content>Grupo de capacidades estratégicas</content>
          </child>
          <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-9376e44b9e755798a7f2b1207d8d62f1" font="1|Arial|9.0|0|COCOA|1|ArialMT" fillColor="#d1c4e9" textAlignment="1" borderType="1">
            <bounds x="8" y="52" width="404" height="22" />
            <content>Grupo de capacidades misionales</content>
          </child>
          <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-96851010a4425cfea34b403a0096b6f8" font="1|Arial|9.0|0|COCOA|1|ArialMT" fillColor="#b2dfdb" textAlignment="1" borderType="1">
            <bounds x="8" y="78" width="404" height="22" />
            <content>Grupo de capacidades de apoyo</content>
          </child>
          <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-a921d9bb0fe95d0da00f3f830261fa61" font="1|Arial|9.0|0|COCOA|1|ArialMT" fillColor="#fff3e0" textAlignment="1" borderType="1">
            <bounds x="8" y="104" width="404" height="22" />
            <content>Borde naranja grueso: impacto alto (la hace la aplicación)</content>
          </child>
          <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-e9235ee309575266b40ecad7168798f5" font="1|Arial|9.0|0|COCOA|1|ArialMT" fillColor="#e3f2fd" textAlignment="1" borderType="1">
            <bounds x="8" y="130" width="404" height="22" />
            <content>Borde azul: impacto medio (intercambia información con la aplicación)</content>
          </child>
          <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-b15b00ed16305029a69becfddc83da39" font="1|Arial|9.0|0|COCOA|1|ArialMT" fillColor="#ffffff" textAlignment="1" borderType="1">
            <bounds x="8" y="156" width="404" height="22" />
            <content>Borde gris normal: la aplicación no la toca</content>
          </child>
          <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-8a46a90de9ef5afdb1adda4b13c7827e" font="1|Arial|9.0|0|COCOA|1|ArialMT" fillColor="#f5deb3" textAlignment="1" borderType="1">
            <bounds x="8" y="182" width="404" height="22" />
            <content>Recurso: va dentro de la capacidad a la que se asigna</content>
          </child>
